   OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.2:3b
   OLLAMA_KEEP_ALIVE=0
   ENVIRONMENT=production
   BACKEND_PORT=8000
   FRONTEND_PORT=3000
   CORS_ORIGINS=*
   ```

2. **Build and Launch the Stack (CPU / Standard)**:
